### How it works
The app uses a central data store (`chords.json`) containing fingering shapes and music theory mappings. The UI is built with React and Tailwind CSS, rendering SVG diagrams dynamically. For high-quality prints, the system uses a headless browser (Puppeteer) to render the interactive pages as A4 PDFs.

